{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67e4638812cfa87a940435","object":"chat.completion","created":1785193572,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user wants me to embody \"nothing.\" This is a fascinating philosophical prompt. What would nothing itself express?\n\nNothing is... the absence of everything. Void. Emptiness. How does nothing speak? It doesn't. But paradoxically, if I'm to output \"only what the concept itself would say or express,\" then nothing's expression would be silence, emptiness, void.\n\nThis is a paradox by nature - to speak as nothing is to betray nothingness. But perhaps nothing would"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}